        "docs": "Hands the network requests made inside the app's WebView (fetch and XMLHttpRequest) to the native SDK, so they\nshow up in the network logs of tickets. The plugin calls this for you on iOS and Android; each call replaces\nthe previously attached WebView network logs. No-op on web, where the JavaScript SDK records requests itself.",
