          }
        ],
        "returns": "Promise<{ colorScheme: string; }>",
        "tags": [
          {
            "name": "since",
            "text": "18.2.0"
          }
        ],
        "docs": "Set the color scheme of the widget. Overrides the color scheme configured in the Gleap dashboard.\nOnly takes effect when \"Adapt to dark / light mode\" is enabled in the dashboard; otherwise the widget\nalways keeps its normal colors.\n\"auto\" follows the device appearance (dark/light mode) on iOS and Android, and the page theme on web.\nApps with their own in-app theme toggle should pass \"light\" / \"dark\" explicitly and call it again whenever\nthe theme changes. \"default\" removes the override and uses the dashboard setting.\nIn dark mode the widget uses the dark mode colors, logo, header image and composer glow set in the Gleap dashboard;\nwithout dark colors it keeps its normal colors. lightBackgroundColor / darkBackgroundColor override the background.\nCan be called before or after initialize and applies live.",
        "complexTypes": [],
        "slug": "setcolorscheme"
      },
